# Pagination

A small Python project demonstrating automated bug investigation
and evidence-backed repair with ProofLoop.

## Bug

The pagination function skips the first item on every page after
the first page due to an incorrect starting index.

## Expected behavior

- Pages use 1-based numbering.
- Each page returns the correct number of items.
- The final page may contain fewer items.
- Invalid page numbers and page sizes raise ValueError.

